---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
const lastUpdated = 'August 25, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="Terms of use for USAPrizes.com, covering acceptable use, content accuracy, third-party links, and liability."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <Breadcrumbs items={[{ name: 'Terms of Use', href: '/terms/' }]} />
      <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <h2>Acceptance of terms</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing or using USAPrizes.com, you agree to these Terms of Use, our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>, and our <a href="/disclaimer/">Disclaimer</a>. If you do not agree, please do not use this site.
      </p>

      <h2>Informational content only</h2>
      <p>
        Content on this site &mdash; including lottery results, casino reviews, rankings, and
        guides &mdash; is provided for general informational purposes only and does not
        constitute legal, financial, or gambling advice. See our <a href="/disclaimer/">Disclaimer</a> for details on age restrictions, lottery
        affiliation, and the sweepstakes-casino model.
      </p>

      <h2>Accuracy of information</h2>
      <p>
        We make reasonable efforts to keep lottery results, reviews, and legal-status
        information accurate and current, but we do not warrant that any information on this
        site is complete, accurate, or up to date at all times. Always verify lottery results
        against your official state lottery and verify a sweepstakes casino's current terms and
        legal availability directly with the operator before acting.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party sites</h2>
      <p>
        This site contains links to third-party operators and services we do not control,
        including via affiliate links (see our <a href="/editorial-policy/">Editorial Policy</a>).
        We are not responsible for the content, terms, or practices of any third-party site.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the fullest extent permitted by law, USAPrizes.com and its operators are not liable
        for any loss or damage arising from your use of this site, your reliance on any
        information published here, or your use of any third-party service linked from this
        site.
      </p>

      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        Original content on this site (text, graphics, and layout) is owned by USAPrizes.com
        unless otherwise noted. Third-party trademarks, including operator and lottery names,
        belong to their respective owners and are used for identification purposes only.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these Terms of Use from time to time. Continued use of the site after a
        change constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms: contact details are published on our <a href="/about/">About</a> page.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
